      {
        "BodyText": "Used normally, the output is simply the contents of the file requested, such as Story.txt:"
      },
      {
        "Nature": "Informative",
        "ExampleCode": "```\n\t./catWrapper Story.txt\n```"
      },
      {
        "Nature": "Result",
        "ExampleCode": "```\n\t When last we left our heroes... \n```"
