      },
      {
        "BodyText": "The $userName variable is not checked for malicious input. An attacker could set the $userName variable to an arbitrary OS command such as:"
      },
      {
        "Nature": "Attack",
        "ExampleCode": "```\n\t;rm -rf /\n```"
      },
