        "Nature": "Result",
        "ExampleCode": "```\n\t./catWrapper Story.txt; ls\n```"
      },
      {
        "BodyText": "Two commands would then be executed: catWrapper, then ls. The result might look like:"
      },
      {
        "Nature": "Result",
