        "Nature": "Result",
        "ExampleCode": "```\n\tls -l /home/;rm -rf /\n```"
      },
      {
        "BodyText": "Since the semi-colon is a command separator in Unix, the OS would first execute the ls command, then the rm command, deleting the entire file system."
      },
